{% extends 'base.twig' %}{% block content %}<section class="container page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A CLEAR DIRECTION</p><h1>Built with intention.<br><span class="serif">Growing with feedback.</span></h1><p>A transparent view of what’s here and what still needs work.<br>Priorities may evolve as real applications teach us more.</p></section><section class="container roadmap-grid"><article class="roadmap-column"><span class="tag tag-green">Available · development preview</span><h2>The foundation</h2><ul><li>HTTP kernel & named routing</li><li>Container & middleware</li><li>Validation & escaped templates</li><li>DBAL & migration commands</li><li>Sessions & security primitives</li><li>Cache, events, mail & logging</li><li>CLI application generator</li><li>Documentation & complete starters</li><li>Auth, roles & scoped tokens</li><li>Models, relations & pagination</li><li>Local Elang Studio</li><li>Content Studio & revisions</li><li>Read-only documentation MCP server</li><li>Database jobs & UTC scheduling</li><li>Private SSE & WebSocket channels</li><li>React, Next.js & CORS integration</li><li>Idempotency for JSON writes</li><li>English, Azerbaijani & Russian content</li></ul></article><article class="roadmap-column"><span class="tag">Next priorities</span><h2>Earn a stable release</h2><ul><li>Broader compatibility testing</li><li>Independent security review</li><li>API feedback & stabilization</li><li>Release & support policy</li><li>Packagist publication</li><li>Reproducible benchmarks</li><li>More complete sample applications</li></ul></article><article class="roadmap-column"><span class="tag tag-neutral">Planned · no promised dates</span><h2>Grow deliberately</h2><ul><li>Optional ORM integration</li><li>Distributed broker adapters</li><li>Shared cache & limiter adapters</li><li>Editor & agent integration</li><li>Upgrade tooling</li></ul></article></section><div class="container callout-row"><div><h3>Help us choose the useful next step.</h3><p>Share a concrete use case or a reproducible issue on GitHub.</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/ElgunHeydarli/elangphp.com/issues">Join the conversation ↗</a></div>{% endblock %}
